<?xml version="1.0"?>
ICS-213 GENERAL MESSAGE
INCIDENT NAME: Hurricane Response Exercise 2026
TO (Name/Position): County EOC Logistics Section Chief
FROM (Name/Position): Shelter 4 Communications Unit Leader
SUBJECT: Resource Request - Cots and Water
DATE: 06/12/2026
TIME: 0915 local
MESSAGE:
Request the following resources be delivered to Shelter 4 located at
the County Fairgrounds, 1200 Exhibition Drive, no later than 1400 today:
 - 150 folding cots with pads
 - 40 cases bottled water (24 count)
 - 6 portable LED light towers
 - 2 ADA accessible portable restroom units
Current shelter population is 312 and rising. We expect to exceed 400
by nightfall based on the evacuation order for Zone B. Medical needs
station reports adequate supplies for now but requests resupply of
basic first aid kits within 24 hours.
APPROVED BY (Name/Position): J. Martinez, Shelter Manager
SIGNATURE: /s/ J. Martinez
REPLY:
